function renderAccounts(){
 const write=canWriteOwner(currentOwnerId)&&can('manage_accounts');$('newAccountBtn').disabled=!write;const list=own(accounts);$('accountList').innerHTML=list.length?list.map(a=>{const v=accountBalance(a),credit=a.account_type==='credit',avail=credit?Math.max(0,Number(a.credit_limit||0)-v):null,p=credit?cardStatementPeriod(a):null;return `<div class="item"><div class="row between"><div class="grow"><div class="item-title">${safe(a.name)}</div><div class="small muted">${accountTypeLabel(a.account_type)} · ${credit?'Deuda':'Saldo'} inicial ${money(a.opening_balance)}</div>${a.opening_note?`<div class="small muted">${safe(a.opening_note)}</div>`:''}${credit&&p?`<div class="small muted">Periodo tarjeta ${p.start} → ${p.end} · Compras periodo ${money(cardPeriodSpend(a))}</div>`:''}${credit&&a.due_day?`<div class="small muted">Próximo límite de pago ${nextDayOfMonth(a.due_day)}</div>`:''}</div><div class="right"><div class="amount ${credit?'warn':v<0?'bad':'good'}">${credit?'Debes '+money(v):money(v)}</div>${credit?`<div class="small muted">Crédito disponible ${money(avail)}</div>`:''}</div></div>${credit?`<div class="mini-grid" style="margin-top:9px"><div class="muted-box"><div class="small muted">Pago mínimo</div><b>${money(a.minimum_payment)}</b></div><div class="muted-box"><div class="small muted">Para no generar intereses</div><b>${money(a.no_interest_payment)}</b></div></div>`:''}<div class="row" style="margin-top:9px"><span class="pill ${a.active?'good':'bad'}">${a.active?'Activa':'Inactiva'}</span><button class="btn secondary edit-account" data-id="${a.id}" ${!write?'disabled':''}>Editar</button>${credit&&a.active?`<button class="btn blue pay-card" data-id="${a.id}" ${!can('modify_amounts')?'disabled':''}>Pagar tarjeta</button>`:''}<button class="btn ghost toggle-account" data-id="${a.id}" ${!write?'disabled':''}>${a.active?'Desactivar':'Activar'}</button></div></div>`}).join(''):'<div class="empty">No hay cuentas ni tarjetas.</div>';document.querySelectorAll('.edit-account').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>editAccount(b.dataset.id));document.querySelectorAll('.pay-card').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openCardPayment(b.dataset.id));document.querySelectorAll('.toggle-account').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>toggleAccount(b.dataset.id));
}
